{title: 547 - Be Thou My Vision}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #547 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 547}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Be [Ab]Thou [Eb]my [Fm]Vi[Bb]sion, [Eb]O[Cm]Lord [Eb]of [Fm]my [Eb]heart;
[Bb]Naught [F7]be [Bb]all [F]else [Gm]to [Eb]me, [Cm]save [Bb]that [Eb]Thou [Bbsus]art[Bb][Eb]
[Ab]Thou [Fm]my [Cm]best [Eb]Tho[Gm]ught, [Gm]by [Bb]day [Eb]or [Bb7]by[Cm]nig[Bb]ht,
[Cm]Waking [Bb]or [Eb]sleeping, Thy [Fm]pres[Cm]ence [Ab]my [Eb]light.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb][Ab]Be [Eb]Thou [Fm]my [Bb]Wisdom, [Eb]and [Cm]Thou [Eb]my [Fm]true [Eb]Word;
[Bb][F7]I [Bb]ever [F]with [Gm][Eb]Thee [Cm]and [Bb]Thou [Eb][Bbsus]with [Bb]me, [Eb]Lord;
[Ab][Fm]Thou [Cm]my [Eb][Gm]great [Gm]Father, [Bb]I [Eb][Bb7]Thy [Cm]true [Bb]son;
[Cm]Thou [Bb]in [Eb]me [Fm]dwelling, and [Cm]I [Ab]with [Eb]Thee one.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb][Ab]Riches [Eb]I [Fm]heed [Bb]not, [Eb][Cm]nor [Eb]man's [Fm]empty [Eb]praise,
[Bb][F7]Thou [Bb][F]mine [Gm][Eb]Inheritance, [Cm][Bb]now [Eb][Bbsus]and [Bb][Eb]always:
[Ab][Fm]Thou [Cm]and [Eb][Gm]Thou [Gm]only, [Bb]first [Eb][Bb7]in [Cm]my [Bb]heart,
[Cm]High [Bb]King [Eb]of [Fm]Heaven, [Cm]my [Ab]Treasure [Eb]Thou art.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Eb][Ab]High [Eb]King [Fm][Bb]of [Eb]Heaven, [Cm][Eb]my [Fm]victory [Eb]won,
[Bb][F7]May [Bb]I [F]reach [Gm][Eb]Heaven's [Cm]joys, [Bb]O [Eb][Bbsus]bright [Bb]Heaven's [Eb]Sun!
[Ab][Fm]Heart [Cm][Eb]of [Gm]my [Gm][Bb]own [Eb]heart, [Bb7][Cm]whatever [Bb]befall,
[Cm]Still [Bb]be [Eb]my [Fm]Vision, [Cm]O [Ab]Ruler [Eb]of all.
{end_of_verse}
